        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">指値注文と逆指値注文: 本当の違いは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t818e3799c4b466c7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Buy Limit: normally below current market price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">買い指値: 通常は現在の市場価格を下回ります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t972f1a566421f130",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trader expecting a pullback before continuation might use a limit order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレンドが再開する前の押し目を想定するトレーダーは、指値注文を使うことがあります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb256147eb81fc8e2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trader who only wants to enter after price crosses a breakout level might use a stop order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
