    },
    {
      "key": "te757770fe308788d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review the expiration setting.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">有効期限の設定を見直してください。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t72cc5beda521f9ab",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">逆指値注文</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf324e6c32ddff293",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review the expiration and submit the order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">有効期限を確認して注文を送信します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbeeb03a536db4613",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Common Mistakes Do Traders Make With Order Types?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレーダーは注文タイプに関してどのようなよくある間違いを犯しますか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9bf4a5a5d93cc3d1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Using a market order when the plan requires a pullback.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">押し目を待つ計画なのに成行注文を使うこと。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb653462dca5633e7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Confusing Buy Stop entries with Stop Loss instructions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">買いストップエントリーとストップロス指示を混同します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t86a1c0edaeea1859",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forgetting to review pending-order expiration settings.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保留中のオーダーの有効期限設定を確認するのを忘れています。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ted4b63cac467f98c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Ignoring slippage risk during fast markets.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">相場が急速に動くときのスリッページリスクを無視すること。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta0106ac7ee7ef1c7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Focusing on entry type while overlooking trade size and leverage.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">取引サイズやレバレッジを無視しつつ、エントリータイプに焦点を当てます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t698710084fcfc546",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">FAQs About Market, Limit and Stop Orders</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">成行注文、指値注文、逆指値注文に関するよくある質問</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9b0daf42a383cd2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: What is a market order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: 成行注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdbd15bdc590f028e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: What is a stop order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: 逆指値注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9fc1223ea53bd108",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: A stop order is a pending instruction that activates after market price reaches the specified stop level. On MT5, Buy Stop and Sell Stop orders trigger corresponding market operations once their conditions are met.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: 逆指値注文は、市場価格が指定された逆指値レベルに達した後に有効化される保留中の命令です。 MT5 では、条件が満たされると、買いストップ注文と売りストップ注文が対応する市場操作をトリガーします。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1c21a35f9e48fc9f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: A Buy Stop is a pending buy instruction normally placed above the current market price. It is used when the trader wants a buy operation to activate only after the price reaches the chosen higher trigger level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: 買いストップは、通常、現在の市場価格よりも上に設定される保留中の購入指示です。これは、トレーダーが、価格が選択したより高いトリガーレベルに達した後にのみ購入操作をアクティブ化したい場合に使用されます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0fe1a71e7f614a46",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: What is the difference between a limit order and market order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: 指値注文と成行注文の違いは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t672763a208ef67f4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: What is the difference between a stop and limit order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Q: 逆指値注文と指値注文の違いは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf140b4597912e745",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: A limit order normally waits for a more favorable price than the current market, while a stop order waits for the price to reach a trigger level before activating. Their placement relative to the current market and their activation mechanics are therefore different.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A: 通常、指値注文は現在の市場よりも有利な価格を待ちますが、逆指値注文は価格がトリガーレベルに達するのを待ってからアクティブになります。したがって、現在の市場に対するそれらの配置とその活性化メカニズムは異なります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te081b62c6693c4a2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex and CFD trading involves leverage and significant risk of loss. Order types control how trading instructions are submitted and activated, but they do not guarantee execution at a particular price or a profitable outcome.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外国為替およびCFD取引にはレバレッジと重大な損失リスクが伴います。注文タイプは、取引指示の送信方法と有効化方法を制御しますが、特定の価格での約定や収益性を保証するものではありません。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7bac7c78eac4c286",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex correlation is the statistical tendency of two currency pairs to move in relation to each other. A correlation coefficient ranges from -1 to +1, showing opposite, independent or similar movement. Correlation matters because opening several positions in closely related pairs can concentrate trading exposure instead of providing genuine diversification.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-correlation-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-correlation-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外国為替相関とは、二 つの通貨ペアが相互に関連して動く統計的傾向です。相関係数の範囲は -1 から +1 で、反対の動き、独立した動き、または同様の動きを示します。密接に関連するペアで複数のポジションをオープンすると、真の分散を提供する代わりに取引エクスポージャーが集中する可能性があるため、相関関係が重要です。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcd054a75e19d1c2f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understanding forex correlation helps traders identify these relationships before opening additional positions. It can also improve how traders interpret correlation matrices, compare market exposure and assess whether several trades are genuinely different ideas or variations of the same one.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-correlation-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-correlation-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外国為替の相関関係を理解することは、トレーダーが追加のポジションを開く前にこれらの関係を特定するのに役立ちます。また、トレーダーが相関行列を解釈し、市場エクスポージャーを比較し、複数の取引が本当に異なるアイデアなのか、それとも同じアイデアのバリエーションなのかを評価する方法も改善できます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc87be1cfa698309d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is the basic answer to what is correlation in forex. It is not a prediction that two markets must move together in the future. Instead, it measures the relationship observed across the price data being analysed.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-correlation-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-correlation-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">これが外国為替における相関とは何かに対する基本的な答えです。 二 つの市場が将来一緒に動かなければならないという予測ではありません。代わりに、分析対象の価格データ全体で観察される関係を測定します。</span>"
    }
  ]
}
